#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:3
#: 1ed7c2f078e841458d6497e49d1dc2bd
msgid "Fleet segments"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:5
#: 6e734e05a72b4c2d84009793a132885a
msgid "The European Fishing Control Agency's `Guidelines on Risk Assessment Methodology <https://www.efca.europa.eu/en/content/guidelines-risk-assessment-methodology-fisheries-compliance>`_ define fleet segments as *'fishery units with similar fishing characteristics (e.g., gear, area and target species)'*."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:9
#: 26eb64d102c244739544fb1226c6506c
msgid "Each member state is responsible for defining the fleet segments relevant to its waters and to perform risk assessments on each segment."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:15
#: e1fc906b904b4752b1be747ea2c55472
msgid "Fleet segment risk assessment and control objectives"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:17
#: cf94a50ef5054ff0b907102e5a8dc71e
msgid "In France, fleet segments were defined by the `Direction des Pêches Maritimes et de l'Aquaculture <https://agriculture.gouv.fr/administration-centrale>`_, and risk assessments on these fleet segments are performed each year by the `Directions Interrégionales de la Mer <https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Direction_interr%C3%A9gionale_de_la_Mer#:~:text=Les%20directions%20interr%C3%A9gionales%20de%20la,marin%20et%20gestion%20des%20ressources>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:21
#: 56de45a5ce9642ac9312edb93aa3b177
msgid "During this process, a **risk level** is computed for each fleet segment based on"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:23
#: d80e6f55a26e4a04b18ebd8eb865ef9b
msgid "scientific data on the **state of the stock** (healthy, threatened, collapsed...)"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:24
#: 56933166321c4a2fad3ed46eece7dda9
msgid "national metrics to estimate the **pressure** that the fishing activity puts on the stock and the **level of non-compliance** observed on the fleet segment"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:26
#: 171c33ce129e4ffab75546b00bbf019e
msgid "This risk level represents the **impact of the fishing activity** on the ressources."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:28
#: 5b5d2483629b4bb2a17324d600419451
msgid "In addition, and based on the risk assessment conclusions, an objective of a minimum number of controls to perform on each fleet segment is defined."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:31
#: 7469ace8cdb34775b6597c5890831a80
msgid "Fleet segments definition"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:33
#: fd5113a00a6b473ca77f369ca2ff3b30
msgid "Fleet segments are defined for each year in the :doc:`back office <back-office>`, by their gears, target species, mesh, FAO areas, vessel types and the minimum share of target species in catches. Each segment also has an impact risk factor (see :doc:`risk-factor`). The segments of a new year can be initialized from those of the previous year."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:37
#: 6bc5f9019f774fe19f2a207d8024d0c9
msgid "The current definitions of fleet segments are published on data.gouv.fr by the :doc:`flows/controls-open-data` flow."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:39
#: 11b798b13cd84e2fa7be5df027c6178d
msgid "Definitions of fleet segments in the back office"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:43
#: 3d00073fcfad4f0d9a816291910f3321
msgid "*Definitions of fleet segments in the back office*"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:46
#: 7469ace8cdb34775b6597c5890831a80
msgid "Fleet segments computation and display"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:48
#: e6456c5da74949339a22e03862e57b75
msgid "The :doc:`flows/current-segments` flow computes the fleet segments each vessel belongs to in real time, based on ERS data."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:50
#: 51ea7de13b424bc2aade10fd4ddfe942
msgid "Fishing vessels' fleet segment(s) can then be visualized on the map in real time (as vessel labels), in the :doc:`vessel sheet <vessel-sheet>` and in the :doc:`vessel list <vessel-list>`, where vessels can be filtered based on their fleet segments."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/fleet-segments.rst:53
#: 520627cf37a84be19b25a7ec98f2e237
msgid "The fleet segments of controls are computed when the inspection report is entered (see :doc:`missions-and-controls`), and can be recomputed with the :doc:`flows/recompute-controls-segments` flow. The fleet segments of :doc:`prior notifications <prior-notifications>` are computed by the :doc:`flows/enrich-logbook` flow."
msgstr ""

